{"id": "DZZ-Lj6uwM5", "title": "Video by kallawaymarketing", "description": "Here’s how to write a hook so good it is scientifically impossible to skip.\n\nThis is called the Triple Hook Method.\n\nAnd if you do this right, it will hypnotize the viewer in a way where they physically cannot scroll away.\n\nStep 1 is the Context.\n\nThis is the basic step, but so many people still get this wrong.\n\nViewers only watch content where they have a vested interest in the topic.\n\nSo the first line of the hook must establish context on what the video will be about.\n\nYou can say it in the audio, show it in the visuals, write it in the text or caption, ideally all 3 aligned, but this context must be established immediately.\n\nWe’ve have data that shows even delaying context towards the end of the first sentence causes the skip rate to go way up.\n\nSo priority number 1 is to set immediate context.\n\nNow Step 2 is where most people mess up.\n\nThis is the lean.\n\nWhat you’re trying to do is get someone curious in a certain direction.\n\nYou want them to lean in on the context and actively want to hear more.\n\nNow you can make this lean happen in a variety of ways…\n\nBut regardless of which method you pick, the viewer must lean in and not opt out.\n\nSo when you read back that first 1-2 sentences on its own…is the context clear and is there something curiosity inducing that would make you lean in and want to hear more?\n\nContext Lean…this is what “opens the curiosity loop” you hear people talk about.\n\nNow step 3 is really where the money’s made.\n\nI call this, the Contrarian Snapback.\n\nTo catch a fish, you get the hook in its mouth swimming one way, and then you jerk back the other way.\n\nNot to be morbid.\n\nStorytelling is the same way.\n\nThe goal is to say something that pulls the viewer away from the direction they were just leaning.\n\nEssentially, snapping them back down another path.\n\nIs the god-tier hook formula that works every single time.\n\nComment “hooks” and I’ll send it through so you can level up your hooks\n\nFollow @kallawaymarketing for more videos like this.\n\n#storytelling #marketing #creator #contentstrategy #hooks", "channel": "kallawaymarketing", "uploader_id": "67218622229", "uploader": "Kallaway", "timestamp": 1781095505, "like_count": 19848, "comment_count": 10629, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1717157392772820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.252, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fdmm2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP4bkW64pFac3DWwKBIPN79SivDarsRRdP3PYH_nJkTIJOON4aKFp8mDHtr3awDE5iv_crwXQh8R5qI8riD_O0sQ3EAUhDPtQGp4fA.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdqNml00a-QzMRK-58mZ_LB0n6HCwq3Zn4ElMO9EkfyjwEplIPMuPagQkU4SgV43eAISG-3FcB6hTVmikiSh5ysw&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fdmm2-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=OFKzMqqR2Q4Q7kNvwG1oUz5&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=EOlSqOCnCk0NMTlGbae1eg&_nc_ss=7b689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRuGkK7wcBZiTGvp_siIerPnaK1a0yhjqWEozbBZqcPUg&oe=6AF0E2DE", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 66.252, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-1717157392772820a - audio only (DASH audio)"}, {"url": "https://instagram.fdmm2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNjNglq358V771fyvK6EKDHpeBPmSapIfHVDXZs235xK0FsEdCMGYpJeMSTKGP8q1mtBQANeu07VasR23jg8Emu_jk4MimV0T59_PU.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=Adr4UBivsczxWSAPJNfvdiBf9sTw5NlbAsR6s3WhaX_EdxXDg3E8Ct7rqTf0dlLjGnqtSsZaei2-m6vcfBhFi0Tk&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fdmm2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=92y6nuA2z